#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:5
#: c8c6d724f9f54c87a3c5c62f841a46e1
msgid "Funding Committee"
msgstr "资金委员会"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:7
#: f39cc6aa30314850bd58c99ad6e12c6b
msgid ""
"ArduPilot collects funds through donations from :ref:`individuals <common-"
"donation>` and `Partners <https://ardupilot.org/about/Partners>`__ and these"
" are held within SPI and the ArduPilot Foundation. Some of these funds go to"
" pay for fixed costs including servers (i.e. build servers, wiki servers, "
"etc) and are billed directly to ArduPilot's account within SPI. Other "
"project expenses and support engineer compensation is paid from the "
"ArduPilot Foundation account."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 通过 :ref:`个人捐款 <common-donation>` 和`合作伙伴 "
"<https://ardupilot.org/about/Partners>`__ 筹集资金，资金由 SPI 和 ArduPilot "
"基金会持有。部分资金用于支付固定成本（包括构建服务器、Wiki 服务器等），直接从 ArduPilot 在 SPI "
"的账户中扣除。其他项目支出和支持工程师薪酬则从 ArduPilot 基金会账户中支付。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:10
#: 8df3993715da4c5880f55cc0788bf81d
msgid ""
"The rules governing the Fundinng committee are setforth here: `Funding "
"Committee Rules "
"<https://docs.google.com/document/d/1l6M5fxjoLEv4TQYzvZhbcBYsUlxJOXSIEfELrACp6f8/edit?usp=sharing>`__."
msgstr ""
"资金委员会的管理规则详见：`资金委员会规则 "
"<https://docs.google.com/document/d/1l6M5fxjoLEv4TQYzvZhcBYsUlxJOXSIEfELrACp6f8/edit?usp=sharing>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:12
#: c5ab2fa20ae04515bb2900befe259af4
msgid ""
"Each month SPI publishes an in-month and year-to-date financial report on "
"the Treasurer `page <https://spi-inc.org/treasurer/>`__.  Annual Reports, "
"containing a high level summary, are published `here <https://spi-"
"inc.org/corporate/annual-reports/>`__"
msgstr ""
"SPI 每月在财务`页面 <https://spi-inc.org/treasurer/>`__ "
"发布当月及年初至今的财务报告。包含高层摘要的年度报告发布于`此处 <https://spi-inc.org/corporate/annual-"
"reports/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:14
#: 8f0ac38aeb2f4be4b6ba967926b696db
msgid "This page attempts to outline how ArduPilot Project funds are managed."
msgstr "本页旨在概述 ArduPilot 项目资金的管理方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:17
#: 64bd3cb2fdc04effb852164cba49f922
msgid "Submitting Proposals"
msgstr "提交提案"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:19
#: d22c983b57094ff5bbe98954fb798768
msgid ""
"Anyone may submit a proposal to receive funding by opening a new topic "
"within the `Discuss Forum's Proposal category "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/proposals>`__. Suggestions for what the "
"proposal should include are described `here "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/about-the-funding-proposals-"
"category/12255>`__ and also copied below:"
msgstr ""
"任何人均可在`讨论论坛的提案分类 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/proposals>`__ "
"中发起新主题以提交资金申请。提案应包含的内容建议详见`此处 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/t/about-the-"
"funding-proposals-category/12255>`__，以下也有转载："

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:22
#: 85b5221b8175414fad23026fdde23752
msgid "Proposals should be no more than 2 pages and include:"
msgstr "提案不超过 2 页，应包含："

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:24
#: c2507294cf5341ad899787ead940d070
msgid "description of the project and how it would improve ArduPilot"
msgstr "项目描述及其如何改进 ArduPilot"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:25
#: ed9db7a1587440ed9bce351c6ac30bd6
msgid "how much money is needed"
msgstr "所需资金金额"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:26
#: bb6c25c4afe94fa7a4af8274ea089451
msgid "what resources are needed (hardware, software, time)"
msgstr "所需资源（硬件、软件、时间）"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:27
#: f1f16da46f6741299bd28af3a9cf6c55
msgid "what core developer support is required (if any)"
msgstr "所需的核心开发者支持（如有）"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:28
#: cc0a2f0675524f038736554da425287b
msgid ""
"timespan for the completion of the project (and milestones if longer than 3 "
"months)"
msgstr "项目完成时间跨度（超过 3 个月时需列明里程碑）"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:29
#: 9183641a8bee41288bf9dcf2c846d84e
msgid ""
"what skills the developer has to complete the task (i.e. past experience "
"contributing to ArduPilot)"
msgstr "开发者完成任务所具备的技能（即向 ArduPilot 贡献的过往经验）"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:31
#: 2b266cadee1645efa218b8fda681686a
msgid ""
"All proposal submissions are considered public information, and may be "
"disclosed to whatever audience is relevant at the time, such as developer or"
" partner meetings and group calls, and may be published on the website or "
"forums."
msgstr "所有提案均视为公开信息，可向相关受众披露，例如开发者或合作伙伴会议及群组通话，也可发布在网站或论坛上。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:34
#: c6a3bdf41d684497b558198273f72a92
msgid "Evaluating Proposals"
msgstr "评估提案"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:36
#: 533544c486714b9b903df2b6f86fd3c5
msgid ""
"The ArduPilot funding committee is made up of three elected members from the"
" team with elections held each December.  The currently elected members are:"
msgstr "ArduPilot 资金委员会由每年 12 月选举产生的三名团队成员组成。目前当选成员为："

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:38
#: e3944b4c5e8d4a488c983ee9a9dcdaee
msgid "Tom Pittenger"
msgstr "Tom Pittenger"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:39
#: 41768741ab414a5380f6781787473b61
msgid "James Pattison"
msgstr "James Pattison"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:40
#: df289b3e1266449da2278f50e5b8d059
msgid "Andy Piper"
msgstr "Andy Piper"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:42
#: 353925f1672b4397bdbb09d25171c4ba
msgid ""
"This committee reviews the `Proposal category "
"<https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/proposals>`__ regularly and evaluates "
"proposals based on both the benefit to ArduPilot and likelihood of success. "
"The approve/reject decision is made by a simple majority vote (i.e. 2 of 3 "
"must approve)."
msgstr ""
"该委员会定期审查`提案分类 <https://discuss.ardupilot.org/c/proposals>`__，并根据对 ArduPilot "
"的益处和成功可能性评估提案。批准/拒绝决定通过简单多数表决做出（即 3 票中至少 2 票同意）。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:45
#: 3db74ec6fa6846ddad7a904968a1f5de
msgid ""
"The committee has authority to decide on its own for funding requests up to "
"$2000.  Above this, if the funding committee approves of the request, a "
"member of the funding committee should raise a vote for the wider dev team "
"to decide on the proposal."
msgstr ""
"委员会有权自行决定不超过 2000 美元的资金申请。超过此金额时，若资金委员会批准该申请，应由委员会成员发起投票，由更广泛的开发团队对提案作出决定。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:47
#: 029c6182dfcc4a1291419a395f3adf24
msgid "Additional guidance:"
msgstr "额外指导意见："

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:49
#: 70262cdb6792490f8e104e42047475d2
msgid ""
"requests for small amounts of funding (eg. $200 to buy a new sensor) "
"generally have a very low threshold for funding. Larger requests receive "
"more scrutiny."
msgstr "小额资金申请（例如 200 美元购买新传感器）通常门槛很低。较大的申请将受到更严格的审查。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:50
#: 543aaed02f954e93a6b2871485725e80
msgid ""
"for larger requests (i.e. over $2000) the committee may ask the applicant to"
" undertake a smaller sub-task first to demonstrate their ability to take on "
"the larger task."
msgstr "对于较大的申请（超过 2000 美元），委员会可能会要求申请人先完成较小的子任务，以证明其承担更大任务的能力。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:51
#: 792c74d6b3554ff8afba63ce3199d925
msgid ""
"specific proposals are favored over less specific ones. For example, a "
"proposal to “improve ArduPilot” would be less likely to be funded compared "
"with a proposal to “add support for the XYZ gyroscope”."
msgstr "具体的提案比模糊的提案更受青睐。例如，「增加对 XYZ 陀螺仪的支持」的提案比「改进 ArduPilot」的提案更有可能获得资助。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:52
#: 4b648fb9b70345daba8e18ea1dbab7d8
msgid ""
"we should keep red-tape to a minimum. There is no point in there being 10 "
"hours of admin for a $200 request. Small proposals should be encouraged "
"which are just a few paragraphs, and the person should get their money "
"quickly and with a minimum of fuss."
msgstr ""
"应将繁文缛节降至最低。对于 200 美元的申请，花费 10 小时行政处理毫无意义。应鼓励只需几段话的小型提案，申请人应能快速、简便地获得资金。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:53
#: e0f7037da4474701b2f4b898e13dc3ea
msgid ""
"all proposals should receive and accepted or rejected response within a "
"reasonable amount of time."
msgstr "所有提案应在合理时间内收到批准或拒绝的回复。"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:56
#: b3d9ae3808e94244b79349007d8cbcac
msgid "Getting Paid"
msgstr "获得付款"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:58
#: 55420765d0e941d1b88d597eaa898401
msgid "Payments from ArduPilot are made in one of two ways:"
msgstr "ArduPilot 的付款方式有两种："

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:60
#: ebb215c3874f46c08f40e34a3c5e894f
msgid ""
"ArduPilot's SPI liaison (the team member who has been elected to be the main"
" point of contact with SPI) can make payments via PayPal"
msgstr "ArduPilot 的 SPI 联络人（被选定为与 SPI 主要联系人的团队成员）可通过 PayPal 付款"

#: ../../source/docs/how-the-team-works-development-fund.rst:61
#: b5494ba236574556b798c115e4bdae67
msgid ""
"Through direct bank transfer.  Follow the `instructions here to create a "
"Reimbursement Request <http://spi-inc.org/treasurer/reimbursement-form/>`__ "
"and send to ArduPilot's SPI liaison along with receipts"
msgstr ""
"通过直接银行转账。按照`此处说明创建报销申请 <http://spi-inc.org/treasurer/reimbursement-"
"form/>`__，连同收据发送给 ArduPilot 的 SPI 联络人"
